\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Identify unspoken concerns.\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Distinguish disagreement from disloyalty.\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Anticipate implementation problems.\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Repair impact without abandoning appropriate standards.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
